    "slug": "inventory-dead-stock-cash-conversion-cycle-indian-d2c",
    "title": "Inventory Dead-Stock & Cash-Conversion Cycle Math for Indian D2C Brands: How 30-Day Reorder Batches Free ₹1,50,000 in Working Capital",
    "date": "November 17, 2026",
