    "slug": "msme-payment-delays-section-43bh-upi-qr-retainers-india",
    "title": "MSME Payment Delays & Freelancer Retainers in India: How Section 43B(h), Milestone Splits, and UPI QR Invoices Cut Collection Time to 5 Days",
    "date": "November 8, 2026",
