    "slug": "whatsapp-commerce-wa-me-links-packaging-qr-playbooks",
    "title": "WhatsApp Commerce Without Monthly API Fees: Direct wa.me Links, Pre-Filled Order Scripts, and Packaging QR Funnels",
    "category": "Sales",
